# OPTIONAL: review host audit capacity and existing policy before installation.
# Native 64-bit syscalls only. Do not use on a 32-bit kernel.
-a always,exit -F arch=b64 -S execve,execveat -F success=1 -k alinksec_exec
# For x86_64 compatibility programs, add a separately reviewed b32 rule.
# Never flush existing audit policy with -D.
